        {
          "text": "🧩 Fill-in-the-Blank Exercises",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "🧩 Fill-in-the-Blank Exercises"
        },
        {
          "text": "Complete each sentence with a word from this page.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Complete each sentence with a word from this page."
        },
        {
          "text": "1.  The __________ keeps the animals healthy and well-fed.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "1. The __________ keeps the animals healthy and well-fed."
        },
        {
          "text": "2.  Lions and tigers live in the big cats __________.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "2. Lions and tigers live in the big cats __________."
        },
        {
          "text": "3.  The zoo has a special __________ programme for endangered species.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "3. The zoo has a special __________ programme for endangered species."
        },
        {
          "text": "4.  We watched the dolphins through the glass at the __________.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "4. We watched the dolphins through the glass at the __________."
        },
        {
          "text": "5.  Many animals in the zoo cannot survive in the __________ anymore.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "5. Many animals in the zoo cannot survive in the __________ anymore."
        },
        {
          "text": "6.  The snake exhibit is inside the __________ house.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "6. The snake exhibit is inside the __________ house."
        },
        {
          "text": "7.  Flamingos, parrots, and toucans live in the bird __________.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "7. Flamingos, parrots, and toucans live in the bird __________."
        },
        {
          "text": "8.  The __________ told us interesting facts about the crocodile.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "8. The __________ told us interesting facts about the crocodile."
        },
        {
          "text": "9.  A baby elephant is called a __________.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "9. A baby elephant is called a __________."
        },
        {
          "text": "10. We bought souvenirs at the __________ shop near the exit.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "10. We bought souvenirs at the __________ shop near the exit."
        },
        {
          "text": "Answer Key",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Answer Key"
